Package: cutting-board
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Cutting Board contributors
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-tk, python3-psutil
Recommends: xdg-utils
Description: IDE-independent local Services workspace
 Cutting Board discovers TCP listeners, groups them by inferred development
 project, displays process and resource information, and lets the current user
 stop processes without returning to an IDE or terminal.
